Z||000002||Raydar||06-03-2000||11:31 PM||||On the face of things, that's kind of high for a Formula with that many miles. May not be bad, though, if the car has been well maintained / cared for.  <BR>Since he is a mechanic, you might ask if he has records of service performed, and parts replaced. <BR>Any idea why he is selling it?   ||||reg||1
